  <text>
    <body>
      <p><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-343-388"><seg source="#source-343-352">（一）</seg></hi><seg source="#source-388-423">たそがれ告ぐる鐘の音に</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-423-590" style="padding-inline-start: 1em">
        <p><seg source="#source-458-493">誘はれて散る木々の葉の</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-493-525">雪は夕日に照りはへて</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-525-554">げに厳めしの銅像や</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-592-637"><seg source="#source-592-601">（二）</seg></hi><seg source="#source-637-666">自由の祖先高知市の</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-666-824" style="padding-inline-start: 1em">
        <p><seg source="#source-701-727">偉人を偲ぶ銅像の</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-727-756">其の勇ましき姿こそ</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-756-788">永き偉人のかたみなれ</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-826-886" style="padding-inline-end: 1em; text-align: right">
        <p><seg source="#source-856-886">（大正十三・一・六）</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
